{"parse":{"title":"\"Twine Warnings and Tales From the North\"","pageid":395619,"revid":2149790,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">&#34;Twine Warnings and Tales From the North&#34;</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fc/Constellation_Twine_Warnings_and_Tales_From_the_North.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024432\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation &quot;Twine Warnings and Tales From the North&quot;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fc/Constellation_Twine_Warnings_and_Tales_From_the_North.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024432\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fc/Constellation_Twine_Warnings_and_Tales_From_the_North.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024432 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fc/Constellation_Twine_Warnings_and_Tales_From_the_North.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024432 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation &quot;Twine Warnings and Tales From the North&quot;\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_%22Twine_Warnings_and_Tales_From_the_North%22.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation &quot;Twine Warnings and Tales From the North&quot;.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22O_Lips,_Weave_Me_Songs_and_Psalms%22\" title=\"&quot;O Lips, Weave Me Songs and Psalms&quot;\">\"O Lips, Weave Me Songs and Psalms\"</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22Seek_Not_to_Tread_the_Sly_Fox%27s_Path%22\" title=\"&quot;Seek Not to Tread the Sly Fox&#39;s Path&quot;\">\"Seek Not to Tread the Sly Fox's Path\"</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Elemental Burst <a href=\"/wiki/Runo:_All_Hearts_Become_the_Beating_Moon\" title=\"Runo: All Hearts Become the Beating Moon\">Runo: All Hearts Become the Beating Moon</a> is enhanced:<br /><ul><li> <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Pale Hymn</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Pale Hymn</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">A hymn passed down by generations of Moonchanters that increases the DMG dealt by Bloom, Hyperbloom, Burgeon, and Lunar-Bloom reactions.<br /><br />Lauma can gain Pale Hymn stacks in the following ways:<br /><ul><li> When using her Elemental Burst Runo: All Hearts Become the Beating Moon.</li><li> When consuming Moon Song stacks due to using her Elemental Burst Runo: All Hearts Become the Beating Moon.</li><li> When the Frostgrove Sanctuary triggers the effect of her Constellation \"I Offer Blood and Tears to the Moonlight\".</li></ul><br />When party members deal Bloom, Hyperbloom, Burgeon, or Lunar-Bloom DMG, 1 stack of Pale Hymn will be consumed and the DMG dealt will be increased based on Lauma's Elemental Mastery. If this DMG hits multiple opponents at once, then multiple stacks of Pale Hymn will be consumed, depending on how many opponents are hit.<br />The duration for each stack of Pale Hymn is counted independently.</span></span></span> effects are increased: All nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> members' Bloom, Hyperbloom, and Burgeon DMG is further increased by 500% of Lauma's <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a>, and their Lunar-Bloom DMG is further increased by 400% of Lauma's Elemental Mastery.</li></ul><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b>: All nearby party members' Lunar-Bloom DMG is increased by 40%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_Additive_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction Additive Base DMG Bonus\">Reaction Additive Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bloom_Additive_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bloom Additive Base DMG Bonus\">Bloom Additive Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hyperbloom_Additive_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hyperbloom Additive Base DMG Bonus\">Hyperbloom Additive Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Burgeon_Additive_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burgeon Additive Base DMG Bonus\">Burgeon Additive Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_Additive_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom Additive Base DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Bloom Additive Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ascendant_Gleam\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ascendant Gleam\">Ascendant Gleam</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Reaction_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Reaction DMG Bonus\">Elemental Reaction DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Bloom DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign:_Ascendant_Gleam\" title=\"Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam\">Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>\"Twine Warnings and Tales From the North\"</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_2_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 2 Constellation\">Level 2 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522Twine_Warnings_and_Tales_From_the_North%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>\"Twine Warnings and Tales From the North\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">「纺出那终北的告诫与述说」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Fǎngchū Nà Zhōngběi de Gàojiè yǔ Shùshuō\"</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">\"Weave Those Warnings and Tales of the Far North\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「紡出那終北的告誡與述說」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Fǎngchū Nà Zhōngběi de Gàojiè yǔ Shùshuō\"</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">「北の戒めを綴りて</span> <span lang=\"ja\">伝承を語れ」</span><